WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.250
Born to wonder.

00:02.250 --> 00:04.500
The first fracture is curiosity.

00:04.500 --> 00:06.750
Every answer leaves a trace.

00:06.750 --> 00:09.000
Loss changes the shape of light.

00:09.000 --> 00:11.250
Memory settles in the body.

00:11.250 --> 00:13.500
The self keeps moving.

00:13.500 --> 00:15.750
Meaning arrives in echoes.

00:15.750 --> 00:18.000
Still becoming.

00:18.000 --> 00:20.250
Phos, refracted.
